Capacity overage is
your option there.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:05.970
And then capacity events
in Real-Time Hub allow you

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.270
to know what's going on in your
capacity in real time and set

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.520
up triggers and actions.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.280
And you can dive deeper
with the capacity metrics

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:17.100
and chargeback apps that allow
you to know everything going

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:20.820
on in your capacity and
really identify root causes

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.670
and inform capacity planning.

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:26.490
And if you need more, we have
